@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### POST /documents — embed and store a single piece of text
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "content": "To reset your password, click Forgot Password on the login page."
}

### POST /documents — office hours
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "content": "Our office is open Monday to Friday, 9am to 5pm."
}

### POST /documents — payment methods
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "content": "You can pay by credit card, bank transfer, or PayPal."
}

### GET /search — semantic search (different words than stored text)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=I%20forgot%20my%20login%20credentials&limit=5

### GET /search — office hours query
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=When%20can%20I%20visit%20the%20office&limit=5

### GET /sources — list uploaded files and chunk counts
GET {{baseUrl}}/sources

### POST /upload — upload notes.txt (multipart)
# The file content below is stored as one chunk and becomes searchable by source.
POST {{baseUrl}}/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="notes.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Our refund policy lets customers return any product within 30 days. Refunds are
issued to the original payment method and take 5 to 7 business days.

To reset your password, click "Forgot Password" on the login page. A reset link
will be sent to your email and expires after 1 hour.

Support is available Monday to Friday, 9am to 5pm. For urgent issues, use the
live chat on our website or call the hotline.

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### GET /search — search within a specific file only
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=how%20long%20do%20I%20wait%20for%20my%20money%20back&source=notes.txt&limit=5

### DELETE /sources/:name — delete a file and all its chunks
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/sources/notes.txt
